    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends have their return to school interrupted when their school becomes corrupted by the forces of SIN. Embark on an adventure to explore the corrupted school, solve puzzles, and battles evil monsters in turn-based combat with the power of FAITH.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is a tribute to Brazilian culture, religion, and wildlife, especially from the rural countryside and backlands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR SINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends\u2013Angela, Junior, and Lucia\u2013have their return to school interrupted by a Delusion: a twisted force that corrupts a place with the energy of SIN, turning animals hostile and distorting reality based on traumas and nightmares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FRIENDS OR FOES?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the Delusion, Arthur and his friends rely on the power of hope, an energy known as FAITH, and their imagination. But hope alone won\u2019t help these defenseless children, you will meet mysterious entities that might give you tips on how to stay on your feet while facing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DANGER EVERYWHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a linear gameplay flow focused on dialogue and exploration, you must solve puzzles and face enemies in turn-based combat within the corrupted school. The more enemies you fight, the stronger you become by accumulating FAITH and coins, used to upgrade your characters to unlock new skills and increase parameters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is inspired by horror games made in RPG Maker and adapted into a 3D perspective, with strong influences from retro PSX-style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A sinister and distorted atmosphere;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 playable characters, each with unique stories and mechanics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based combat featuring unique SIN and FAITH systems;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sacrifice Coins of FAITH to upgrade your characters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nostalgic visuals with original, hand-painted digital textures;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An original and distorted soundtrack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/8df3e5b3212c79b7adcb5ed4e24f8378.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends have their return to school interrupted when their school becomes corrupted by the forces of SIN. Embark on an adventure to explore the corrupted school, solve puzzles, and battles evil monsters in turn-based combat with the power of FAITH.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is a tribute to Brazilian culture, religion, and wildlife, especially from the rural countryside and backlands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR SINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends\u2013Angela, Junior, and Lucia\u2013have their return to school interrupted by a Delusion: a twisted force that corrupts a place with the energy of SIN, turning animals hostile and distorting reality based on traumas and nightmares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/5550fc09f8a74c11d23a47f17b91f773.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FRIENDS OR FOES?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the Delusion, Arthur and his friends rely on the power of hope, an energy known as FAITH, and their imagination. But hope alone won\u2019t help these defenseless children, you will meet mysterious entities that might give you tips on how to stay on your feet while facing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/ea18320eb32a878aca169e94ddfffa42.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DANGER EVERYWHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a linear gameplay flow focused on dialogue and exploration, you must solve puzzles and face enemies in turn-based combat within the corrupted school. The more enemies you fight, the stronger you become by accumulating FAITH and coins, used to upgrade your characters to unlock new skills and increase parameters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.poster.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.webm?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/b9a17c3a786d0c30b0b4177c1a9e7210.mp4?t=1751919824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is inspired by horror games made in RPG Maker and adapted into a 3D perspective, with strong influences from retro PSX-style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A sinister and distorted atmosphere;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 playable characters, each with unique stories and mechanics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based combat featuring unique SIN and FAITH systems;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sacrifice Coins of FAITH to upgrade your characters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nostalgic visuals with original, hand-painted digital textures;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An original and distorted soundtrack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/extras/8df3e5b3212c79b7adcb5ed4e24f8378.avif?t=1751919824\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
